    "previous": [
      [
        "PUBLIC LAKE PIER",
        "Rails close ahead."
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "map": "MnDuluth",
    "label": "MnDuluth_SUPERIOR_LOOKOUT_SIGNText",
    "source": "dialogue_overhaul",
    "previous": [
      [
        "LAKE SUPERIOR",
        "The water is vast."
      ],
      [
        "Keep behind rails."
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "map": "MnDuluth",
    "label": "MnDuluth_LAUNCH_SIGNText",
    "source": "dialogue_overhaul",
    "previous": [
      [
        "LOW HARBOR LAUNCH"
      ],
      [
        "Put in from shore.",
        "Stay inside the"
      ],
      [
        "rocks."
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "map": "MnDuluth",
    "label": "MnDuluth_MN_DULUTH_PIER_FISHERText",
    "source": "dialogue_overhaul",
    "previous": [
      [
        "This end's good",
        "for a rod. For a"
      ],
      [
        "CANOE, take the",
        "low launch east of"
      ],
      [
        "the houses. You",
        "want water at your"
      ],
      [
        "feet, not a rail",
        "in front of you."
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "map": "MnDuluth",
    "label": "MN_DULUTH_X_LAKEWALK_FISHERText",
    "source": "dialogue_overhaul",
    "previous": [
      [
        "Lift your line",
        "clear of the rail"
      ],
      [
        "if it starts",
        "rubbing. I lost"
      ],
      [
        "one that way. Came",
        "home with half a"
      ],
      [
        "line and a good",
        "story about how"
      ],
      [
        "big it was."
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "map": "MnDuluthLakesideHome",
    "label": "MN_DULUTH_X_LAKESIDEHOME_F1_HOSTText",
    "source": "dialogue_overhaul",
    "previous": [
      [
        "The pier has",
        "rails. I used to"
      ],
      [
        "think they were",
        "for the kids. Then"
      ],
      [
        "I leaned on one in",
        "a west wind."
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "map": "MnDuluthReadingHall2F",
    "label": "MN_DULUTH_X_READINGHALL_F2_HOSTInteriorText",
    "source": "dialogue_overhaul",
    "previous": [
      [
        "I was at the pier",
        "rail at eight. Two"
      ],
      [
        "boats sounded",
        "their horns. I"
      ],
      [
        "couldn't see",
        "either one. Tell"
      ],
      [
        "the reader",
        "upstairs at"
      ],
      [
        "WEATHER STUDY how",
        "low I was. Ask at"
      ],
      [
        "LOOKOUT LODGE if",
        "you want the view"
      ],
      [
        "from up high."
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "map": "MnDuluthReadingHall2F",
    "label": "MN_DULUTH_X_READINGHALL_F2_HOSTInteriorRepeatText",
    "source": "dialogue_overhaul",
    "previous": [
      [
        "Two horns at",
        "eight. Couldn't"
      ],
      [
        "see the boats. I",
        "was down on the"
      ],
      [
        "pier with my hand",
        "on the rail."
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "map": "MnStPaul",
    "label": "MN_ST_PAUL_SIGN_RIVERText",
    "source": "dialogue_overhaul",
    "previous": [
      [
        "RIVER PARK",
        "Stay on the bank."
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "map": "MnStPaul",
    "label": "MN_SPX_RIVER_RECORD_1Text",
    "source": "dialogue_overhaul",
    "previous": [
      [
        "NORTH BANK GAUGE.",
        "The water touches"
      ],
      [
        "a notch below the",
        "bottom step. You"
      ],
      [
        "can read it from",
        "behind the rail."
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "map": "MnBoundaryWaters",
    "label": "MN_BOUNDARY_DOCKHANDText",
    "source": "dialogue_overhaul",
    "previous": [
      [
        "I put my CANOE in",
        "at the north end."
      ],
      [
        "The rocks take the",
        "worst of the waves"
      ],
      [
        "there. If the",
        "water's coming"
      ],
      [
        "over the rail, I",
        "stay on the dock"
      ],
      [
        "and wait."
      ]
    ]
  },
